<title>GERMANY: German Feb plant, machinery orders down real 6 pct.</title>
<headline>German Feb plant, machinery orders down real 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering orders fell by six percent in real terms in February from the same 1996 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said.</p>
<p>In the three-month December through February period orders were one percent below the year-earlier period. The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    February     change in pct  Dec-Feb	     change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    -6	   overall		-1</p>
<p>    of which German  -2	   of which German    +5</p>
<p>		 foreign -10	  foreign		-7</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
